            <text class="cp-airline-title" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'CA'}}">🇨🇳 中国国际航空官方改名规则</text>
            <text class="cp-airline-title" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'CZ'}}">🇨🇳 中国南方航空官方改名规则</text>
          </view>

          <view class="cp-fee-banner">
            <text class="cp-fee-label">官方真实收费：</text>
            <text class="cp-fee-amount" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'CX'}}">$60 美元 (约 ¥430) / 错字小修免费</text>
            <text class="cp-fee-amount" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'MU'}}">同音错别字 100% 免费直接修正！</text>
            <text class="cp-fee-amount" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'CA'}}">官方收取 ¥100 变更费 / 错字免费</text>
            <text class="cp-fee-amount" wx:if="{{correctionAirline === 'CZ'}}">同音错字免费修正，官方不加收手续费</text>
          </view>

          <view class="cp-steps-box">
            <text class="cp-step-item">1. 切勿在 OTA 平台点击“退票”（OTA 会扣除 50%~80% 退票费）</text>
            <text class="cp-step-item">2. 携带身份证/护照原件直接拨打航司官方客服热线</text>
            <text class="cp-step-item">3. 报出 13 位客票号，客服将在系统中直接更正姓名拼写！</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <button class="confirm-modal-btn" bindtap="closeNameCorrectionModal">我知道了</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 7. FLIGHT DISRUPTION REFUND MODAL ==================== -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showDisruptionModal}}" bindtap="closeDisruptionModal">
    <view class="modal-sheet" catchtap="preventDumb">
      <view class="modal-sheet-header">
        <view>
          <text class="modal-sheet-title">🔄 航变 100% 无损退改维权指南</text>
          <text class="modal-sheet-sub">中国民航局《航班正常管理规定》法定权益</text>
        </view>
        <view class="modal-close-btn" bindtap="closeDisruptionModal">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="modal-body-scroll">
        <view class="disruption-rule-box">
          <text class="dr-title">⚖️ 旅客法定核心权益：</text>
          <text class="dr-p">1. **延误 15 分钟及以上**：航司即构成航班变动，旅客享有**100% 全额无损退票权**，免收任何手续费！</text>
          <text class="dr-p">2. **免费自愿改签**：可免费改签至航司前后 7 天内任意直飞航班（即使原购特价票亦享受免费改签）。</text>
          <text class="dr-p">3. **公章延误证明**：航司官网/官方 App 均支持直接下载带红色公章的 PDF 延误证明，用于信用卡理赔。</text>
        </view>

        <button class="confirm-modal-btn" bindtap="closeDisruptionModal">了解维权标准</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 8. TICKET VERIFIER MODAL ==================== -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showTicketVerifierModal}}" bindtap="closeTicketVerifierModal">
    <view class="modal-sheet" catchtap="preventDumb">
      <view class="modal-sheet-header">
        <view>
          <text class="modal-sheet-title">🔍 中航信 13 位电子客票验真</text>
          <text class="modal-sheet-sub">直连中航信电子客票库，杜绝假行程单与幽灵票</text>
        </view>
        <view class="modal-close-btn" bindtap="closeTicketVerifierModal">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="modal-body-scroll">
        <view class="ticket-input-box">
          <text class="tib-lbl">电子客票号 (13位)</text>
          <input class="tib-input" type="number" placeholder="例如：781-2491823901 (东航)" value="{{verifyTicketNo}}" bindinput="onTicketNoInput" />
        </view>

        <button class="verify-action-btn" bindtap="handleVerifyTicket">
          立即验真
        </button>

        <view class="verify-result-box" wx:if="{{verifyResult}}">
          <text class="vr-title">✓ 客票状态：中航信官方已开票 (OK)</text>
          <text class="vr-desc">承运航司：中国东方航空 · 舱位：J 舱 (公务舱)</text>
          <text class="vr-desc">行程：北京首都 PEK ✈ 上海虹桥 SHA · MU5101</text>
          <text class="vr-safe-tag">100% 官方正规客票，绝非加价中介票！</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 9. SPECIAL SERVICES MODAL ==================== -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showSpecialServicesModal}}" bindtap="closeSpecialServicesModal">
    <view class="modal-sheet" catchtap="preventDumb">
      <view class="modal-sheet-header">
        <view>
          <text class="modal-sheet-title">♿ 特殊旅客官方直申指南</text>
          <text class="modal-sheet-sub">跳过中介代办收费，航司官方通道 100% 免费申请</text>
        </view>
        <view class="modal-close-btn" bindtap="closeSpecialServicesModal">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="modal-body-scroll">
        <view class="special-service-item">
          <text class="ss-title">👶 婴儿摇篮 / 婴儿餐 (免费)</text>
          <text class="ss-desc">起飞前 48 小时拨打航司官方电话或在官方 App 直申，免费安排第一排大空间婴儿摇篮位。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="special-service-item">
          <text class="ss-title">🧑‍🦽 轮椅旅客出行保障 (免费)</text>
          <text class="ss-desc">支持机舱客梯轮椅与窄体登机轮椅全程陪护，安检走专用 CIP 绿色通道。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="special-service-item">
          <text class="ss-title">🐕 宠物进客舱 (官方合规申请)</text>
          <text class="ss-desc">海航、川航支持符合尺寸的小型犬猫随同进入客舱，官方收费仅 ¥1399/只，需起飞前 24h 申请。</text>
        </view>

        <button class="confirm-modal-btn" bindtap="closeSpecialServicesModal">我知道了</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 10. ADD WISHLIST RADAR MODAL ==================== -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showAddWishlistModal}}" bindtap="closeAddWishlistModal">
    <view class="modal-sheet" catchtap="preventDumb">
      <view class="modal-sheet-header">
        <text class="modal-sheet-title">✨ 添加新的 24h 放票监控雷达</text>
        <view class="modal-close-btn" bindtap="closeAddWishlistModal">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="modal-body-scroll">
        <view class="add-wish-box">
          <text class="aw-lbl">选择监控航线</text>
          <view class="aw-route-pills">
            <view class="aw-pill {{selectedNewRoute === 'PEK_SHA' ? 'aw-pill-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectNewRoute" data-route="PEK_SHA">北京 ⇄ 上海</view>
            <view class="aw-pill {{selectedNewRoute === 'SZX_PEK' ? 'aw-pill-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectNewRoute" data-route="SZX_PEK">深圳 ⇄ 北京</view>
            <view class="aw-pill {{selectedNewRoute === 'CAN_SHA' ? 'aw-pill-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectNewRoute" data-route="CAN_SHA">广州 ⇄ 上海</view>
          </view>

          <text class="aw-lbl">监控模式</text>
          <view class="aw-route-pills">
            <view class="aw-pill {{selectedNewMode === 'PASS' ? 'aw-pill-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectNewMode" data-mode="PASS">次卡/随心飞放票</view>
            <view class="aw-pill {{selectedNewMode === 'PRICE' ? 'aw-pill-active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectNewMode" data-mode="PRICE">低价拦截</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <button class="handoff-cta-btn" bindtap="confirmAddWishlist">
          立即开启 24h 毫秒级雷达监控
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 11. BOARDING PASS ENLARGED MODAL ==================== -->
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showBoardingPassModal}}" bindtap="closeBoardingPassModal">
    <view class="modal-sheet modal-pass-sheet" catchtap="preventDumb">
      <view class="modal-sheet-header">
        <text class="modal-sheet-title">🎫 官方电子登机牌 (VIP快速安检)</text>
        <view class="modal-close-btn" bindtap="closeBoardingPassModal">✕</view>
      </view>

      <view class="enlarged-pass-content">
        <view class="pass-barcode-big"></view>
        <text class="pass-barcode-pnr">PNR: J8KQ2M · ZHANG/SAN</text>
        <text class="pass-scan-hint">安检及登机口直接出示此码即可快速核验通行</text>

        <view class="pass-quick-info-grid">
          <view class="pqi-box">
            <text class="pqi-lbl">航班</text>
            <text class="pqi-val">MU5101</text>
          </view>
          <view class="pqi-box">
            <text class="pqi-lbl">登机口</text>
            <text class="pqi-val gold-bright">C42</text>
          </view>
          <view class="pqi-box">
            <text class="pqi-lbl">座位</text>
            <text class="pqi-val">12F</text>
          </view>
          <view class="pqi-box">
            <text class="pqi-lbl">舱位</text>
            <text class="pqi-val">公务舱</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- ==================== 12. FIXED BOTTOM TAB BAR ==================== -->
  <view class="bottom-tab-bar" wx:if="{{currentView === 'home'}}">
    <view class="tab-item {{activeTab === 'home' ? 'tab-active' : ''}}" bindtap="switchTab" data-tab="home">
      <text class="tab-icon">🏠</text>
      <text class="tab-label">首页</text>
    </view>

    <view class="tab-item {{activeTab === 'wishlist' ? 'tab-active' : ''}}" bindtap="switchTab" data-tab="wishlist">
      <text class="tab-icon">✨</text>
      <text class="tab-label">愿望雷达</text>
    </view>

    <view class="tab-item {{activeTab === 'trips' ? 'tab-active' : ''}}" bindtap="switchTab" data-tab="trips">
      <text class="tab-icon">🧳</text>
      <text class="tab-label">我的行程</text>
    </view>

    <view class="tab-item {{activeTab === 'wallet' ? 'tab-active' : ''}}" bindtap="switchTab" data-tab="wallet">
      <text class="tab-icon">🪪</text>
      <text class="tab-label">卡包与维权</text>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
